      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this section is relevant because I am adding `libstagefright_foundation` and `libcodec2_hidl@1.0` to `ProdDclaMixedBuildsEnabledList`.\n\nBefore this change\n```\n# Platform variants\n- GetApexConfigKey returns nil\n- Cquery requests platform configuration of these two libraries for platform variants\n\n# Apex variants\n- GetApexConfigKey returns nil !\n- Cquery requests platform configuration of these two libraries for apex variants !\n```\n\nAfter this change which adds this two libs to the allowlist, platform variants remains the same, but for apex variants, we pass an apexKey to the cquery call",
