      "writtenOn": "2023-06-26T16:51:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this fine? In bp2build we\u0027re now _always_ allowing access to implementation rather than stubs if we\u0027re in the correct domain. It\u0027s likely worth doing some analysis to verify or instead always using stubs if there are multiple potential apexes.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1992,
        "startChar": 19,
        "endLine": 1993,
        "endChar": 27
      },
      "revId": "da2ae59d76465b9e60e120c785ba5006fa3314c1",
