      "message": "I\u0027m not concerned about the cflags, but rather building against an implementation where one should build against stubs\n\nA case like: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/bp2build/cc_library_shared_conversion_test.go;l\u003d654-671;drc\u003de266787aed74a6b2f3368f9eee4d263386074c9f\n\nwould be relevant. if e.g. we were building `apexbar` and instead chose `apexfoo` as the domain.\n\nIf we\u0027re confident this is not relevant for the current use cases, it\u0027s fine to submit this; otherwise, please file a bug as a followup.",
